title: "cryosweep"
abstract: >-
  Analysis of Quantum Design PPMS/MPMS measurement files: magnetization (VSM), AC
  susceptibility, thermal transport, resistivity, heat capacity and Hall effect, with a
  Qt-free core, a JSON contract, a command-line interface and a PySide6 desktop GUI.
